  m_Text: "<b>Controls:</b>\nPress <b>1</b> -  Roll Dice\nHold <b>Trigger</b> - Buy
    abilities (Flashbang, Pump\u2019n\u2019Dump, Reroll)\n<b>Joystick</b> - Nudge
    dice (within 3s after rolling)\n\nPress <b>A</b> - change hand colour!\nPress
    <b>B</b> - mute BG Music\nPress <b>Y</b> - ready up!"
